Workout history database migrations.

Local dev/tests still use `init_db()`'s `Base.metadata.create_all()` (see
`app/history/database.py`) — this Alembic setup is for reviewable schema
migrations going forward. No deployment currently runs `alembic upgrade head`
automatically (tracked as part of the AWS ECS deployment sub-project).

To create a new migration after schema changes:
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

To apply migrations:
  alembic upgrade head

To rollback migrations:
  alembic downgrade base